# --- Belt and braces -----------------------------------------------------
# Instructor material lives in ../instructor/ and must never appear in
# this repository, which students can read. These patterns are a second line
# of defence in case a file is ever copied back in by accident. The first
# line of defence is that those files are not in this directory at all.
NOTES-INSTRUCTOR.md
grade_*.sh
instructor/
solutions/
